:724427219,"textPrimary":4292738555,"textSecondary":4287952109,"invertedBackground":4285722084,"overlayBackground":3422764344},"colorSampledDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"Get your FPL Team rated for FREE 👉 https://bit.ly/4mwOxFQ\nWin your mini-league or your money back 👉 https://bit.ly/4vHkijC\nT\u0026Cs 👉 https://bit.ly/3Rxg2oN\n#AD \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nIn this video I talk about my new FPL Team/Drafts ahead of Gameweek 1. The \"main\" team, the no Bench Boost Team, the best structure (maybe?), and then no Haaland.\n\nLast seasons rank = 588th!\n\nBest 5 ranks = 588, 1294, 4935, 8492, 9975.\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🙏 Subscribe: https://bit.ly/SubLTFPL\n👍 Follow me: https://linktr.ee/letstalkfpl\n💪 Become a channel member: https://bit.ly/LTFPLYTMember\n📩 Business Inquiries: andy@letstalkfpl.com \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nJoin my league 👉 glojzb\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n00:00 Intro\n00:35 Main Team - Defence\n06:37 Main Team - Midfield\n11:45 Main Team - Forwards (RELAX)\n22:25 No Bench Boost team\n25:58 My favourite structure\n31:32 No Haaland\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":36,"length":22,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwihqZH88quWAxW8U_IAHRRAGLhIzPTM2Z3EgKZlygEEPDpTNg==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUm4yXzY5YUhGaURubEdDZk1MUWNYM3xBR3JiS2FuSVROZXZNRzFUcnNIbWl2Y3MtelJzbXdwM1ZWQ3RKWEpxMlBCU2tLTTY2SEpMR1FCa29HNElQTng3MXE3S3kwVGIxUTRaSFJFc2YxRWwzMGd5ZkMzQU51YnVkNlBk\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F4mwOxFQ\u0026v=ZUwCIdszOkw","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUm4yXzY5YUhGaURubEdDZk1MUWNYM3xBR3JiS2FuSVROZXZNRzFUcnNIbWl2Y3MtelJzbXdwM1ZWQ3RKWEpxMlBCU2tLTTY2SEpMR1FCa29HNElQTng3MXE3S3kwVGIxUTRaSFJFc2YxRWwzMGd5ZkMzQU51YnVkNlBk\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F4mwOxFQ\u0026v=ZUwCIdszOkw","target":"TARG